comments.body:
@joshbohmer May I ask what pump you use?

A friend of mine uses t:slim X2.  The pump receives readings directly from G6 from its second slot.  If we implement your proposal, he will not benefit because although xDrip will not show incorrectly high readings, the pump will still receive those incorrect readings directly from the transmitter and will inject incorrect insulin.  That's why he disables the pump until he corrects the readings using calibrations.

I'm just curious what pump you use.  I also would like to clarify that not everyone with a closed loop system will benefit from this.

@joshbohmer Would you please update?
Do you still feel this is something that the community will benefit from?
Will you please specify what pump you use?
